WEBVTT

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:34.970
Now let's see...

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:38.290
What this baby can do!

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.280
Takao!

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:04.280
Holy crap!

00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:05.980
That thing's...

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:07.680
A monster!

00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:10.690
I can hardly believe it!

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:14.980
It's stronger than we
ever could have imagined.

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:16.860
This is...

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:20.020
This is the power of
the new Beyblade?

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:36.490
The most important feature of
the new Heavy Metal System

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:38.450
lies in the Attack Ring.

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:42.090
It's much improved over
a typical Attack Ring.

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:48.320
I managed to increase its specs across the board--Like speed, attack, and defense.

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:55.230
But it's also less stable than a typical Attack Ring, so it's more difficult to control.

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:58.020
So it's all up
to the Blader's skill.

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:00.200
So we'll need
to stay focused.

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:05.300
You won't be able
to control it so easily.

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:08.250
Cheer up, Kyoujyu!

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:12.540
We can beat BEGA
if we master these, right?

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:17.140
Yes. I designed these to defeat the BEGA members, after all.

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:20.780
Which means these
are the ultimate Beys!

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:26.900
Yeah! We'll control these,
just you wait and see!

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:31.760
Or maybe you don't trust us?

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:34.720
Never crossed my mind! Ow!

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:39.250
And now we've got plenty
of friends we can rely on!

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.800
We'll do whatever you need.

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:47.580
You're right! We have all of
these wonderful friends with us!

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.010
I'm sure you can
master them!

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:53.080
For sure!
Let's do our best!

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:54.800
Fight!

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.440
Alright!

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:59.090
Let's take down BEGA!

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:01.250
--Yeah!

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:24.100
Three! Two! One!

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:26.340
--Go, Shoot!

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.260
Go!

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:33.890
Rats!

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:42.800
Failure's the
first step to success!

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.180
Let's go again!

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:46.680
Yes. Of course!

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:01.890
The Bey's movements
completely changed!

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:06.260
One more round, Rai.

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:09.340
Yeah. As much as you need!

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:14.920
Here I come!

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:22.060
It just stopped!

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:25.250
Try again, Michael!

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:26.440
Okay!

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:29.300
--Three! Two! One!

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:31.450
--Go, Shoot!

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:41.090
What?

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:48.760
My hand slipped!

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:49.850
Again!

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:52.480
Good luck, guys.

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:54.100
This is new.

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:59.600
Takao would normally be all like
"I can't take it! This sucks!" by now.

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:03.600
But he hasn't gotten
all frustrated yet.

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:07.490
Beyblade is something
everyone is free to enjoy.

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:11.410
Takao's working hard to stick to his faith in Beyblade...

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:14.890
And the same goes
for all of us here.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.450
Their faith in Beyblade...

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:19.200
Yes, their faith in Beyblade...

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:23.130
Because they love it, they
can withstand any hardship.

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:25.720
It's their love for Beyblade!

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:28.610
--Love for Beyblade...

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:31.970
I'm gonna crush BEGA flat!

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:34.620
I'll help you out, Takao.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:36.610
I may not be much
help, but so will I.

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:38.900
And me too!

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:43.420
Going pro is the dream of
all Bladers! They disagreed!

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:48.370
A registered worldwide network! Simple tournament entry.

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:52.210
Availability of information.
Improved support systems.

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:55.210
BEGA has pushed all
of these forward!

00:06:55.210 --> 00:07:00.480
But sadly, there exists one group
with a dissenting opinion.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:05.250
The group started by none other than Takao Kinomiya! And they are strong.

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:10.740
Enough so to take the wind out of our sails! But BEGA will not be defeated.

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:15.770
We will ram into the wall that the champion
Takao Kinomiya puts in our way!

00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:19.690
To do so, we are practicing
day in and day out!

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:23.500
BEGA will fight them to the end!

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:25.900
For Bladers all
over the globe!

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:30.980
Thus the name of our tournament is righteous. I call it the Justice 5!

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:40.570
The stage has been set. Now for Takao Kinomiya to play his part as the villain.

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:45.100
Failed again!

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:46.810
What are we doing wrong?

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:52.540
Darn! I can't control it!

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:54.450
What are we missing?!

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:55.570
Power?

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:56.650
Spirit?

00:07:56.650 --> 00:07:57.810
Is it the shoot?

00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:59.930
What do we need?!

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:01.940
--This sucks!!

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:04.340
Takao, umm...

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:07.580
Where's all that
love for Beyblade?

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:09.600
There's that bad habit...

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:12.080
Spin, darn it!

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:14.290
Freakin' spin!

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:17.580
Out of the way, Daichi!

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:18.860
No, you!

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:21.320
It's spinning!

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:28.340
The Beys need to spin, not you...

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:30.340
They're spinning...

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:32.340
A little better than usual!

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:38.480
Are you two okay?

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:44.240
Hey...

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:45.800
Are they headed
to the mountains?

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:50.480
Go after them!
We don't have any spares!

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:53.800
Get back here!

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.840
Wait for us!

00:08:57.320 --> 00:08:59.360
Let's keep going!

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:01.820
We need to control them.

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:05.520
We won't get
anywhere until can!

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:10.620
That's the spirit!
You can do it!

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.820
Wait!

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:18.990
Wait up!

00:09:22.970 --> 00:09:24.480
--Now!

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:31.660
--Crap...
--They're making fun of us!

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.010
Do they want us
to chase them?

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:39.660
They're totally
making fun of us!

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:41.880
Daichi, let's corner 'em!

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:44.480
I'll take the right.
You take the left!

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:46.500
Right! Left...

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:49.690
This way's right!

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.300
I knew that!

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:57.020
Ultra!

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:57.970
Special move!

00:09:57.970 --> 00:10:01.400
Sandwich Attack!

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:05.290
I'll take the crusts, too!

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:07.210
What the hell?!

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:09.250
Gotcha!

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:28.980
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:35.840
Those kids are hard at work...

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:40.200
They'll be rewarded for
their struggles. I'm sure of it.

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:48.280
We've got a whopper!

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:54.930
What a catch...

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:58.240
Now aren't these familiar...

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:13.170
I'll play along!

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:17.090
Yeah! We'll chase 'em
wherever they go!

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:19.990
Wait!

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:21.800
What in the world?

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:24.420
What indeed...

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:31.980
Shoot!

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:39.450
Not again!

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:45.100
Rick!

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:54.380
I can't spin it...

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:03.140
Here!

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.210
Again!

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:16.850
It won't change anything.

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:18.160
I can control it this time!

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:20.080
No you can't!

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:21.770
I can this time!

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:23.770
You can't.

00:12:24.210 --> 00:12:25.970
The same thing'll
keep happening.

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:30.400
I'll get it to spin!
This time for sure!

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:32.130
I gotta retry!

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:33.580
Shut up!

00:12:35.260 --> 00:12:40.850
Didn't you tell me once that we
can't win if our minds aren't in sync?

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:45.420
You and your Bey
are totally out of sync!

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:49.860
Peace out.

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:53.930
Rick! Rick!

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:58.650
What am I
supposed to do then?!

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:02.100
How do I get it to spin?

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:08.280
Remember the time you
felt your Bey's heart the most.

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:12.570
My Bey's heart...

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:36.680
Give up already?

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:39.530
No way!
We've almost got 'em!

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:42.060
Yeah!

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:46.850
That's my Bey for ya!
It's got guts!

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:51.800
I wonder about that. We were so mad
that we couldn't control our Beys.

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:54.820
It really ticked me off that
they wouldn't listen to us!

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:56.800
But I'm sort
of having fun!

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:58.330
So am I!

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:03.730
This feeling takes me back.

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:05.570
You too?

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:08.410
Yeah, this feeling...

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:14.850
Three! Two! One!

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:16.780
Go, Shoot!

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:19.090
Go!

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:24.440
You can't even control it!

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:25.930
Lame!

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:28.520
Let's go home!

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:40.960
The same feeling from when I launched a Beyblade for the first time!

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:46.260
I couldn't control it.
I screwed up again and again!

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:48.290
Same for me!

00:14:54.650 --> 00:14:55.900
Shoot!

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:08.300
Launching my Beyblade from morning to night!

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:13.130
I couldn't control it at all,
but it was a ton of fun!

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:17.300
Yeah! Not worrying about failure!

00:15:18.570 --> 00:15:20.840
Go, Shoot!

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:29.240
I did it!

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:34.100
I did it! I did it! I spun it!

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:37.100
It was fun.

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:39.970
And before I knew it,
I could control it.

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:45.200
It's the same for these! Like the first
time I tried to launch a Beyblade...

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:46.890
Don't think
about anything else!

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:50.300
And just put all your
feelings into your Beyblade!

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:53.970
Don't think it! Feel it!

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:02.240
Go Dragoon!

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:07.260
Let's win this, Gaia Dragoon!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:19.660
--All right!

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:23.810
A bear?

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:26.140
A b-b-bear...

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:28.380
--Run for it!

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:40.720
This is fun!

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:42.960
It really takes me back...

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:49.860
This time for sure!

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:51.490
Like this, Rei?

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:56.730
--Go, Shoot!

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:02.080
Not again!

00:17:02.260 --> 00:17:04.340
This stinks.

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:06.820
Your shoot's wrong!

00:17:06.820 --> 00:17:09.210
You need more speed!

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:12.160
No, it's the landing!

00:17:12.160 --> 00:17:15.600
It won't spin,
no matter what you do.

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:20.340
Then what do we need?

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:26.330
It's not the shoot,
the speed, or the timing.

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:32.040
Your idle thoughts
are confusing the Bey.

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:34.210
--Confusing the Bey?
--Confusing the Bey?

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:39.560
Let the Bey absorb you.
Control it with your heart.

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:43.980
Control it with your heart.
That's right.

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:47.500
Empty your mind.
Devote everything to the Bey.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:51.340
Thank you all.
I understand now.

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:55.170
I'm glad you cheered up!

00:17:57.360 --> 00:18:03.130
Remember the time you
felt your Bey's heart the most.

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:06.930
That must be it. I forgot.

00:18:06.930 --> 00:18:12.840
The first day I touched a Beyblade.
The day everything else left my mind!

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:16.000
I still have that feeling!

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:17.420
Thank you, Rick!

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:20.500
Thank me later.

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:25.020
You're right.

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:42.820
Never forget the day
I felt my Bey's heart!

00:18:42.820 --> 00:18:44.860
Control it with your heart.

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:51.040
--Go, Shoot!

00:18:52.420 --> 00:18:53.460
Yes!

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:55.370
We shot it!

00:18:58.120 --> 00:19:01.400
Don't celebrate just
because you shot it.

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:07.870
Yeah. Celebrate once you can
knock out our Beyblades!

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:09.520
What?

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:14.080
That's it!

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:15.960
Go!

00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:25.000
It's heavy...
Each hit feels different.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.610
Like I'm hitting a
hunk of steel!

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:36.250
They're controlling the
Heavy Metal System!

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:40.050
Higher spin and
power than ever before...

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:41.720
High speed!

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:47.210
This is the perfected form of
the Heavy Metal System!

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:53.520
I can feel its heartbeat
from all the way up here.

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:56.580
This thing's tiny but packs a punch!
A real wolf in sheep's clothing!

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:57.940
--Go!

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:04.180
I hear two more
wolves on the way.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:05.300
What?

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:07.290
--Get back here!
--Get back here!

00:20:15.680 --> 00:20:17.050
Look at that!

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:19.100
--Takao!

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:20.580
--Daichi!

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:28.940
Takao! Daichi!

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:32.900
We can use these
to beat BEGA!

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.050
Yes! A great success!

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:47.460
Thank you, Kyoujyu!
These are the best Beys ever made!

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:53.340
You guys are amazing! To master the
Heavy Metal System so quickly...

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:59.320
The memory of my first day
with a Beyblade helped me out!

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:00.850
Same for me!

00:21:00.850 --> 00:21:04.800
So you guys
figured it out too?

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:07.620
The innocence we
had back then...

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:12.300
I see! Controlling with with
your heart, not your head!

00:21:12.300 --> 00:21:14.370
The source of your
love for Beyblade!

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:18.920
Yeah! The feeling I had
when I first got a Bey!

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:23.540
And I won't let BEGA get away
with trying to take that from us!

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:27.610
Let's do it, guys!

00:22:55.700 --> 00:22:57.480
I am here.

00:22:58.450 --> 00:23:03.090
I walk a straight path
to determine who I am.

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:05.780
A fragment of a feeling.

00:23:07.290 --> 00:23:09.890
No mercy to those
who block my path.

00:23:10.600 --> 00:23:12.680
And yet, you...

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:15.040
What's your game?!

00:23:16.740 --> 00:23:21.090
Flightless bird,
sing your song!
